sequenceDiagram
  participant G as Agent<br/>no secrets
  participant B as Broker<br/>holds secrets
  participant U as Upstream API
  participant L as Audit log<br/>off-box
  Note over G: all other egress BLOCKED
  Note over B: HIGH-VALUE TARGET
  G->>B: request (allowed egress)
  Note right of B: check policy
  B->>U: call with<br/>short-lived token
  U-->>B: response
  B->>L: record the call
  B-->>G: result only
